    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Karen. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769018244266666
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi, Karen. I need to return an item I bought recently. It's the VeloBand Cadence Sensor.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 30141,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769018248866666
    },
    {
      "text": "I can certainly look into that for you. Can I get your name and order number, please?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769018254933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Sure, the name is Alex Ray, and the order number is VF88712.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 30141,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769018260799998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay, one moment... Alex Ray... VF88712. I see the order here. It looks like it was delivered 25 days ago.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 204,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769018264999998
    },
    {
